                <i class="fas fa-info-circle me-2"></i>
                Fabric rolls are issued from the Inventory module. Go to <a href="{{ BASE_URL }}/inventory/transactions" class="alert-link">Inventory &rarr; Transactions</a> to issue fabric to the cutting room. Once issued, rolls will appear here with relaxation tracking.
            </div>
            <div class="row g-3">
                <div class="col-md-4"><div class="card p-3 text-center border-dashed bg-light"><i class="fas fa-warehouse fa-2x text-muted mb-2"></i><h6 class="fw-bold">1. Fabric in Store</h6><p class="text-muted small mb-0">Rolls received via GRN in Inventory</p></div></div>
                <div class="col-md-4"><div class="card p-3 text-center border-dashed bg-light"><i class="fas fa-truck-loading fa-2x text-muted mb-2"></i><h6 class="fw-bold">2. Issue to Cutting</h6><p class="text-muted small mb-0">Issue rolls from Inventory → Transactions</p></div></div>
                <div class="col-md-4"><div class="card p-3 text-center border-dashed bg-light"><i class="fas fa-hourglass-half fa-2x text-muted mb-2"></i><h6 class="fw-bold">3. Relaxation Track</h6><p class="text-muted small mb-0">Monitor relaxation time (min 24h for woven)</p></div></div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
